@host = http://localhost:5149
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### ========== AUTH ==========

### Register new user (gets User role only)
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "junior1",
  "email": "junior1@example.com",
  "password": "Pass@123"
}

### Login as SuperAdmin (seeded user)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userNameOrEmail": "abd",
  "password": "abd@123456"
}

### Logout note (client deletes token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== TEST AUTHORIZATION ==========

### Public (no token)
GET {{host}}/api/test/public

### Authenticated
GET {{host}}/api/test/authenticated
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin or SuperAdmin
GET {{host}}/api/test/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SuperAdmin only
GET {{host}}/api/test/super-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CanManageUsers policy
GET {{host}}/api/test/manage-users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== PROJECTS (unchanged) ==========

GET {{host}}/api/projects/all
Accept: application/json
